{"density":2.8125,"scaledDensity":2.8125,"fontScale":1,"texts":[{"text":"A strict teacher wakes up trapped inside the body of their worst student.","box":[248,-1986,787,200],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"What format would you like for your video?","box":[45,-1718,990,53],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"1. Video language: English\n2. Captions: Yes, include captions","box":[365,-1640,670,200],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"I'll create a drama based on this template — give me a moment...","box":[45,-1372,990,110],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Story Outline & Characters Result","box":[45,-1206,990,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_header","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Story Outline","box":[90,-1081,900,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_label","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"【Wrong Hands】\nClaire wakes up in a messy bedroom, shocked to discover she is looking at her own reflection as Leo.\n\n【The Hallway Encounter】\nStumbling into the school hallway, Claire in Leo's body runs into a classmate who treats her with unfamiliar, casual hostility.\n\n【Face to Face】\nClaire enters her own classroom and freezes upon seeing her adult body standing authoritatively at the chalkboard.\n\n【The Silent Interrogation】\nLeo corners Claire at the back desk during homeroom, demanding to know what kind of curse she placed on him.\n\n【A Forced Truce】\nClaire whispers instructions on how Leo must act as a teacher while Leo warns her about the impending principal inspection.\n\n【The Pop Quiz】\nLeo steps behind the teacher's podium and announces a surprise test designed to fail Claire in his body before she can intervene.\n\nPossible Characters:\n• Claire — Female lead, high school literature teacher trapped in Leo's body\n• Leo — Male lead, rebellious student piloting Claire's adult body\n• Marcus — Supporting character, aggressive high school classmate","box":[90,-996,900,1892],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":36,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Characters Result","box":[90,989,900,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_characters_label","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"Claire","box":[90,1333,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Leo","box":[372,1333,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Marcus","box":[654,1333,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"I have created the characters for Body Swap.","box":[45,1486,990,53],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"The characters look great! Ready to create the storyboard?","box":[45,1595,990,92],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_chips_lead","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Create storyboard","box":[113,1755,854,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":700,"style":"bold","family":null,"lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_credit_confirm_title","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Credits will be consumed for this task.","box":[113,1807,854,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_credit_confirm_description","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"32","box":[158,1911,34,37],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":31,"sp":11.02,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_credit_confirm_cost","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Generate","box":[717,1881,250,96],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":700,"style":"bold","family":null,"lines":1,"id":"id/button_mini_drama_credit_confirm","window":0,"res":"@color/statusWhite"},{"text":"28787","box":[605,132,110,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_credit","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"}],"fills":[{"box":[0,0,1080,2400],"color":"#FF303030","radius":null,"id":null,"window":0},{"box":[0,0,1080,2400],"color":"#FF0C0C0C","radius":null,"id":null,"window":0,"res":"@drawable/bg_mini_drama_screen"},{"box":[248,-1986,787,200],"color":"#331E9AFF","radius":34,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@drawable/bg_iris_drama_transcript"},{"box":[365,-1640,670,200],"color":"#